# Wave B.b — Flat-edit loading gate + manifest client theme shells

## B.b.1 — Flat-edit `INITIAL_GATE`

### Problem

`use-flat-edit-page.ts` called `resolveDenaliSyncWorkspacePlugin()` at **module scope** to seed `INITIAL_GATE`. That forced a Denali plugin normalize solely for a loading placeholder string, before any template fetch.

### Decision

`INITIAL_GATE` uses `createLoadingWizardTemplateGateState("platform_default")` — a shell-neutral loading profile. The real `workspaceFormProfile` arrives from `resolveWizardTemplateGateState` after `io.loadWizardTemplatePayload()`. Unpublished fallback keeps the same neutral profile until the operator refreshes.

Sync `plugin` inside the hook (draft-shell getter) remains for normalize/submit until Wave B.c (async plugin state).

→ **B.c DONE:** see [`wave-b-async-flat-edit-plugin.mdoc`](./wave-b-async-flat-edit-plugin.mdoc) — client loads via `loadDenaliWorkspacePlugin`; hook takes injected `plugin`.

## B.b.2 — Client bootstrap theme shells from admin theme registry

### Problem

`resolve-bootstrap-workspace-plugin.client.ts` hard-coded a `Map` of `denali` / `urban` / `starter` theme shells (stylesheet path literals). New workspaces with `themeStylesheets` in the manifest still fell back to starter unless this file was edited.

### Decision

Drive theme-shell construction from generated `WORKSPACE_ADMIN_THEME_REGISTRY` (`workspace-theme-stylesheets.generated.ts`):

- `starter` → `getStarterWorkspacePlugin()` (full starter plugin; unchanged)
- any other id present in the registry → clone starter theme shell with `id`, `supportedWorkspaceTypes: [id]`, `optionalStylesheet: sheets[0]`
- unknown id → starter fallback

No hand-maintained denali/urban functions. Drop-in: add `themeStylesheets` to manifest + regenerate.

Still uses `getStarterWorkspacePlugin()` from **`@app-tour/workspace-sdk`** (reference) on the client hydrate path — **not** `@app-tour/workspace-starter` (Wave I.2). Product packages are **not** statically imported here.

## Verify

```bash
pnpm --filter @apps/web exec node --import tsx --test \
  test/create-loading-wizard-template-gate-state.spec.ts \
  test/resolve-bootstrap-workspace-plugin.client.spec.ts \
  test/wizard-create-boundary.spec.ts \
  test/workspace-boundary.spec.ts
rg "getDenaliClientShellPlugin|DENALI_THEME_ADMIN" apps/web/src/bootstrap
```
